; ============================================
; Conveyor Line Control (コンベアライン制御)
; Mitsubishi MELSEC Mnemonic Format
; ============================================
; X010: Emergency stop (非常停止, b接点)
; X001: Start button (起動ボタン)
; X002: Stop button (停止ボタン)
; X003: Product sensor (製品検知センサー)
; Y001: Conveyor motor (コンベアモータ)
; Y002: Warning light (警告灯)
; T0:   Delay timer (遅延タイマー)
;
; Rung 1: Motor start with e-stop + self-hold
; Rung 2: Stop button resets motor
; Rung 3: Warning light (motor AND sensor)
; Rung 4: Delayed stop timer (10sec)
; ============================================
LDI X010
AND X001
OR  Y001
OUT Y001
LD  X002
RST Y001
LD  Y001
AND X003
OUT Y002
LD  Y001
OUT T0 K100
END
